  <name>OpenPDF Studio</name>
  <summary>View and edit PDF documents</summary>
  <description>
    <p>OpenPDF Studio is a modern, cross-platform PDF editor built with Qt6.
       It allows you to open, view, annotate and edit text in PDF documents.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Open and view multi-page PDF documents</li>
      <li>Edit text content inline</li>
      <li>Zoom and navigate pages</li>
      <li>Export and organise pages</li>
      <li>Available in multiple languages</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
